WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:03.338
Your best ideas don't wait. Give them somewhere to go.

00:00:04.267 --> 00:00:07.990
One tap. One thought. Capture it before the moment moves on.

00:00:10.233 --> 00:00:14.993
Turn a wandering voice note into a clear summary. The key points, already pulled together.

00:00:16.167 --> 00:00:19.212
And when a thought needs action, keep the next step close.

00:00:20.167 --> 00:00:23.592
Looking for a detail? Ask your recording. Pick up the thread.

00:00:24.167 --> 00:00:29.715
Keep recording, even offline. Transcribe locally. Generate AI insights when you're connected.

00:00:30.233 --> 00:00:35.078
Less lost in your head. More out in the world. Pure voice. Crystallized thought.
